# Banking Management System

A backend Banking Management application developed using Java and Spring Boot.  
The project provides REST APIs for managing bank accounts, transactions, and customer operations.

## 🚀 Features

- Create Bank Account
- Deposit Money
- Withdraw Money
- Check Account Balance
- Transaction Management
- Exception Handling
- REST API Architecture
- Layered Architecture Implementation

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- Java
- Spring Boot
- Spring Data JPA
- Hibernate
- MySQL
- Maven
- Postman
- Git & GitHub

